// Regla Sigma: proc_creation_win_lolbin_launch_vsdevshell.yml
// ID Sigma: 45d3a03d-f441-458c-8883-df101a3bb146
// Título: Launch-VsDevShell.PS1 Proxy Execution
// Descripción: Detects the use of the 'Launch-VsDevShell.ps1' Microsoft signed script to execute commands.
// Aplica a: Producto: windows | Categoría: process_creation
// Producto: windows
// Categoría: process_creation
// Servicio: 
// Nivel: medium
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Ruta original: C:\SigmaLab\sigma\rules\windows\process_creation\proc_creation_win_lolbin_launch_vsdevshell.yml
// Requiere validación en el entorno de destino.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where ProcessCommandLine contains "Launch-VsDevShell.ps1" and (ProcessCommandLine contains "VsWherePath " or ProcessCommandLine contains "VsInstallationPath ")
